@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090

### Search pharmacies by text fields
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies?name=test&region=Centre&city=Yaounde&page=0&size=10

### Search pharmacies nearby the test pharmacy location
### Test pharmacy POINT(11.5134 3.8893) -> latitude=3.8893, longitude=11.5134
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/Nearby?latitude=3.8893&longitude=11.5134&distance=5000

### Search pharmacies nearby with a wider radius
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pharmacies/Nearby?latitude=3.8893&longitude=11.5134&distance=20000
